  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/958467/description_3e38614b-cad0-4227-813d-a872c4266744.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fnjb6EKaDVJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1152291880218939412?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=orange&link=https://discord.com/invite/njb6EKaDVJ\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fnukateam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/Boosty-Support_us-ff5f5f?logo=boosty&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h1><strong>模組依賴項</strong></h1>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1081/393/64/64/638621132937140582.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nukateams-gun-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/975/675/256/256/638479191021440186.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/871/312/256/256/638288810018379517.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>模組相容性</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/195/772/256/256/636881112930494939.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>警告：此模組處於 Alpha 測試階段！存在缺陷且不適合生存模式。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">NukaCraft 將為 Minecraft 的世界帶來一些核塵。動力裝甲、武器、危險的廢土生物以及殘酷的廢土本身。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組基於：<strong>《輻射》1-4、76、新維加斯，</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>《輻射》模組</strong>以及</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>已刪除內容</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>目前模組新增內容：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">廢土</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">食物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">植物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生態域</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">動力裝甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">輻射系統</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>附加模組 (Addons)</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nuka-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1306/509/64/64/638849485125697689.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"> <strong>Nuka Additions</strong>&nbsp;</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在創建世界時，您需要選擇<strong>「廢土」</strong>世界類型以生成模組的生態域。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNukaTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/4cedab81-cdf9-445c-8d4c-2bba7dc9a836.webp&n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNukaTeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/NukaTeam</a> </span></p>",
